<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2WATESALONIKE</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWA IKABILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA WATESALONIKE</para>
  <para style="toc2">2WATESALONIKE</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tes.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWA IKABILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA</para>
  <para style="mt1">WATESALONIKE</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Lupwilili luno lwa ikabili ha Watesalonike lwandikigwa na mtumigwa wa Kilisto Paulo (1:1). Lupwilili luno kalwandika mkipigiti kiguhi viyeshile kulwandika lupwilili lwa ichanduso ha Wakolosai, mkipigiti cha milao ya 51 songela viyavumbuke Kilisto. Paulo kakala yang'hali mdiwambo da Kolinto kipigiti viyalwandike lupwilili luno ha wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali mdiwambo da Tesalonike, dale da wanhu wamtogole Kilisto diyadisongeze mmwanza wake wa ikabili wa kuupeta Usenga Unogile (Sang'h. 17:1-9). Yandikigwa mkitabu cha Sang'hano kamba dale da wanhu wamtogole Kilisto dikala na Wayahudi kidogo, ila Wagiliki wakala bwando.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali mdiwambo da Tesalonike wagazika ng'hani na mbuli za kipigiti cha kimambukizo na vija Kilisto vondayabwele mwanza wa ikabili, kwavija Paulo kazandika ng'hani mbuli zino mmhwilili zake zose mbili ha Watesalonike. Kamba lwenza lose lwa lupwilili lwa ikabili ha Watesalonike lwandika mbuli za kipigiti cha kimambukizo. Vivija Paulo kolava nzuma mmbuli ya kuleka ukoka. Kila munhu kolondigwa yasang'hanike giladi yapate kinhu cha kuja (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:6-10">3:6-10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo kosonga lupwilili luno mkukiitambula mwenyego na kuwatambula wayage (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho komuheweza Mulungu sama ya wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali mdiwambo da Tesalonike na kuwatambikila (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Muisula ya ikabili, Paulo kolongelela mbuli ya kipigiti cha kimambukizo.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Abaho kolongelela mbuli za kuleka ukoka na kusonga kusang'hanika (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3:1-15</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Paulo komambukiza mkuwalamsa mwanza wa ikabili wanhu wamtogole Kilisto (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Paulo, Sila, na Timoteo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Towandikila wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali mdiwambo da Tesalonike, mkuilumba hamoja na Mulungu Tata wetu na Mndewa Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="2TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Ngekewa na tindiwalo kulawa ha Mulungu Tata wetu na kulawa ha Mndewa Yesu Kilisto viwe hamoja namwe.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhaguso Vondayeze Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Ndugu zetu, mazua gose tolondigwa kumgwelela Mulungu hewela sama yenu. Vinoga tweye kutenda avo, kwavija nhamanila yenu yokula ng'hani, na noge diyalinajo kila munhu mmwanza wenu ha miyage dokongezeka. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Kino kicho kilamso cha tweye kuitopela mweye ha wanhu wayagwe wa Mulungu wamtogole Kilisto. Towalongela hewo vija vimwazaganya na vija vimgendelela kuwa na nhamanila, hata kamba mobitila migayo bwando na kugazika ng'hani.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Gano gose golagusa kamba nhaguso ya Mulungu yabule uzenzeleganye, abaho mopetigwa kamba molondigwa kwingila Muundewa wa Mulungu, awo mweye mgazigwa sama yake. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Mulungu kabule uzenzeleganye. Kowaliha migayo waja wose wowagaza mweye, <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>na kuwagwelela mhumulo mweye mgazigwa, hamoja na tweye. Gano golawilila kipigiti Mndewa Yesu yahafunuligwa kulawa kuulanga muumoto ukwaka hamoja na wasenga zake wa Mulungu wa kuulanga wali na mhiko. <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>Kowasuna waja wose walekile kumtanga Mulungu na walekile kuutogola Usenga Unogile wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Wosunigwa msuno wa ubananzi wa digunge na kwikigwa kutali na kihanga cha Mndewa na yenzi ya mhiko zake, <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>mdizua dondayeze kubokela yenzi na hishima kulawa ha wanhu zake wose, awo wamtogole heyo. Mweye vivija mowa mmwanza wao, kwavija muutogola usenga uja utuwalongele mweye.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Kino kicho kilamso cha tweye kuwatambikila mweye mazua gose. Towatambikila ha Mulungu wetu giladi yawatende mulumbe kukala ukazi uyawakemele mweye. Kubitila mhiko zake yadahe kuzivikiza sulukila zenu zose sama ya unovu na kuimambukiza sang'hano ya nhamanila yenu. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Totambika vino giladi twaga da Mndewa wetu Yesu diyenzigwe mgati yenu, na mweye mgati yake, kamba vija viili ngekewa ya Mulungu wetu na Mndewa Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Ija Imtenda Gehile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Mmbuli ya kwiza kwa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto na kuting'hanizwa kumwetu kuwa hamoja na heyo, ndugu zangu, nowayalalila, <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>sambimdungwedungwe himahima mngelegeza zenu ama mkusinhuswa na awo wolonga Zua da Mndewa diza disha, sambimuwategeleze, hata kamba wahalonga kamba wana nzozi za muloho, lugubulo, ama lupwilili lolose kulawa kumwetu. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Munhu yoyose sambiyawavwizile mnzila yoyose, kwavija zua dija hadiza mbaka uhasanyi mkulu wize tanhu, na ija Imtenda Gehile yafunuligwe, ayo Mulungu yondayam'banange. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Heyo kolema na kukiinula mwenyego mmbuli ya kila kinhu kikemigwa Mulungu ama kitambikiligwa, giladi yakike uchana Muing'anda ya Mulungu, yokiipeta mwenyego kamba iyo Mulungu.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Muisemwa kamba niwalongela mbuli zino kipigiti ving'halile hamoja na mweye? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Na sambi mokitanga kija kimkikiwiza heyo, giladi yafunuligwe mkipigiti kilondigwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Kwavija ija Imtenda Gehile kosang'hanika, ila ija yokikiwiza sambi kogendelela kutenda avo mbaka vondayasegezigwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Abaho, ija Imtenda Gehile kofunuligwa, ila Mndewa Yesu yeheza, komkoma na mhumuzi ya mulomo wake na kum'bananga na unang'hazi wa wizilo wake. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Ija Imtenda Gehile yeheza, mhiko kulawa ha Mwenembago zomtaza kutenda mbuli bwando za uvwizi, kamba vija mizonza, vilaguso, mbuli za mkanganyo, <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>na wiho wa namna zose mkuwavwizila waja wopotela. Wopotela kwavija walema kuinogela ikweli giladi wakomboligwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Avo, Mulungu kowatenda wavwiziligwe ng'hani, na hewo woutogola uvwizi uno. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Abaho wotagusigwa sama ya kuzinogela mbuli zihile kubanza kuitogola ikweli.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Msaguligwa Sama ya Ukombola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Ila ndugu mnogeligwe na Mndewa, tweye mazua gose tolondigwa kumuheweza Mulungu sama yenu, kwavija songela haichanduso Mulungu kawasagula mweye giladi mkomboligwe kubitila sang'hano ya ung'azi ya Loho wa Mulungu na kubitila kuitogola ikweli. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Mulungu kawakema kuukombola kubitila Usenga Unogile utuupetile kumwenu, giladi msangile muna iyenzi ya Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Avo, ndugu zetu, gangamaleni na kugagoga gaja gamafundo tuwafundize tweye, ihawa na mulomo ama na lupwilili lwetu.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Avo Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto mwenyego na Mulungu Tata wetu, ayo yatunogele tweye na kubitila ngekewa yake kotugangamiza mazua gose na tamanilo dinogile, <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>yaigangamize mioyo yenu na kuwagela mhiko giladi mdahe kulonga na kutenda mbuli zose zinogile.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Tutambikileni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Hakimambukizo, ndugu zetu, tutambikileni, giladi Usenga Unogile wenele himahima na uhishimilwe kokose kondauchole kamba viikalile kumwenu. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Vivija tambikeni giladi twimilizwe kulawa mmakono ga wanhu wotenda gehile na wanhu wehile, kwavija sio kila munhu komtamanila Mulungu.<verse eid="2TH 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Ila Mndewa kabule uzenzeleganye, kowagangamiza na kuwemiliza sambimwingile mmakono ga Mwenembago. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Na Mndewa kotugwelela tamanilo kulu mgati yenu, na tweye togelegeza kamba motenda na mogendelela kutenda gaja gose gatuwalongele.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Mndewa kowalongoza mweye muna ilimu ng'hulu ya noge da Mulungu dilavigwe na Kilisto.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzuma ya Kuleka Kusang'hanika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Ndugu zetu, mditwaga da Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto, towalagiza kamba mwinege na wandugu wose wali wakoka na waja woleka kukala ukazi wa kuwinza mafundo gaja gamgabokele kulawa kumwetu. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Kwavija mwemwe wenyego movitanga vija vimulondigwa kuwinza vija vitutenda tweye. Tweye hatukalile wakoka kipigiti vitukalile na mweye. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Hatudile mandia ga munhu yoyose bila kumuliha, ila mkugaya na kudonha ng'hani tusang'hanika ikilo na imisi giladi sambitutamanile kinhu cha munhu yoyose mmwanza wenu. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Tutenda vino sio kwavija hatulondigwe kutazigwa, ila giladi kuwagwelela mweye kilingilo cha kukweleleza. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Kwavija hata vitukalile na mweye, tuwagwelela ndagizi ino, “Kamba munhu yoyose yoleka kusang'hanika, sambimumgwelele kinhu cha kuja.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Kwavija tuhulika kamba wanhu wayagwe mmwanza wenu wakoka. Hawalonda kusang'hanika, ila sang'hano yao kwingilila sang'hano za wanhu wayagwe. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Wanhu kamba hiwo towalagiza na kuwayalalila mditwaga da Mndewa Yesu Kilisto wasang'hanike bila kuilonga vihile giladi wapate mandia gao wenyego.<verse eid="2TH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Ila mweye, ndugu, sambimdonhe kutenda ganogile. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Kamba munhu yoyose yolema kuubokela usenga utuutuma kumwenu mulupwilili luno, muloleni goya munhu ayo. Sambimuilumbe nayo giladi yone kinyala. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Ila sambimumgelegeze kamba mdumuka, ila mumzume kamba ndugu.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuli za Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Mndewa wa tindiwalo mwenyego yawagwelele tindiwalo mianza yose na mzinzila zose. Mndewa yawe hamoja na mweye mose.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Nie, Paulo, nokwandika ndamsa ino na mkono wangu mwenyego. Uno uwo utango mzimhwilili zangu zose. Vino vivo vinyandika.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Ngekewa ya Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto iwe hamoja na mweye mose.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
